    "text": "Let the radius of the circle touching the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and having the directrix of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> as its normal is equal to <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
