  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0051_311dc7c07727.png\" style=\"height: 207px; width: 220px;\" /><br />Equation of normal at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>&nbsp;is<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.25</mn></math></p>"
